#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:5
#: 229f839834f94feaa7d1ff79cb07a0bc 9713d5d795ad46ff8fbb94ff1d3e81fb
#: d98933e0cb444da1be98b185a859d9ad
msgid "BlueOS OpticalFlow Extension"
msgstr "BlueOS 光流（OpticalFlow）扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:9
#: 1c2d8af99d5843ab81f0728516fd85d0 7763832dc1dc4b81a19d1ad7544e345b
#: f5f16e5f44504b62878eb7cdf2d4ff5e
msgid ""
"`BlueOS's Optical Flow Extension <https://github.com/BlueOS-"
"community/blueos-opticalflow>`__ allows a downward facing camera gimbal to "
"be used as an optical flow sensor to improve performance in non-GPS "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"`BlueOS 的光流扩展 <https://github.com/BlueOS-community/blueos-opticalflow>`__ "
"允许将朝下的相机云台用作光流传感器，以改善无 GPS 环境下的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:16
#: 13c033f8dc3c444e894d9a39453effbd 6cc7e11fee574e3c945486aaab22af3c
#: c5f559db6f374698843e134595771ea5
msgid "Support for this extension was added in ArduPilot-4.7"
msgstr "对该扩展的支持在 ArduPilot-4.7 中加入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:19
#: 0be48cf9e6a0435fb9622711632980f3 33b4656062d3410fa3694e2ed5e08282
#: dcaa2ab9120240fdb952890ac5576d9b
msgid "Hardware Required"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:21
#: 2e997d06bd2c41ddbdfb56a79652c2d4 3997d0b302dc4defb08fc5875fe85730
#: 9a2b995795844848a55bf4f85fa1aec9
msgid ""
"Please see :ref:`ArduPilot's BlueOS installation instructions "
"<dev:companion-computer-blueos>` which also includes hardware "
"recommendations."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`ArduPilot 的 BlueOS 安装说明 <dev:companion-computer-"
"blueos>`，其中也包含硬件推荐。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:23
#: 5266783e02ed43b883814b9076b8a7cb 5a17dc8dce6441f58453d19ee3454708
#: eb2f30e8e27a49c196f1ac4d85033674
msgid ""
"Any :ref:`supported camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` with "
"ethernet connectivity should work including the :ref:`Siyi <common-siyi-"
"zr10-gimbal>`, :ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-gimbal>` and :ref:`XFRobot "
"<common-xfrobot-gimbal>` camera gimbals."
msgstr ""
"任何具备以太网连接的 :ref:`受支持相机云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 都应该可用，包括 :ref:`Siyi "
"<common-siyi-zr10-gimbal>`、:ref:`ViewPro <common-viewpro-gimbal>` 和 "
":ref:`XFRobot <common-xfrobot-gimbal>` 相机云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:25
#: 0321bc669acc45edb1f4d6a5cc5451c5 2c6f006a1c424a9986e1d2742206c7bb
#: 623b9e586d0d4b78948639ceb4a0f55a
msgid ""
"The camera gimbal should be mounted on the underside of the vehicle and "
"optical flow will only operate when the camera gimbal is pointing downwards."
msgstr "相机云台应安装在飞行器底部，且光流仅在相机云台朝下时工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:27
#: 373b1367f1df41409533d36095b90b35 46bd9291512446429feb76bc2cb0cf7b
#: 5b93c3af2e5048adafc05d39faddf676
msgid ""
"A :ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` with at least a few "
"meters of range is also required."
msgstr "还需要一个量程至少数米的 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:30
#: 38b5d09105bf473aa84b987fa7ed578e cb436b0138ce48429fd6167cd9376a05
#: f6cafb4035484f1cb4a8f0a4a3805ef0
msgid "BlueOS Extension Installation"
msgstr "BlueOS 扩展安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:32
#: 09263255dc474cd5ab8656027a0e6829 1c09e5af8cec4a2b9400e9658d9936d6
#: ce054e8fe95f4471b9525773bd59d100
msgid ""
"Once BlueOS has been :ref:`installed <dev:companion-computer-blueos>` on the"
" companion computer:"
msgstr "在机载计算机上完成 BlueOS 的 :ref:`安装 <dev:companion-computer-blueos>` 之后："

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:34
#: 6f216dc4ebe64d2585ec3f5354938a0e b89553ba9b8b4692aca5ddd915cbb271
#: c7620db58e9d45bd8cc2a78b4f3fc136
msgid "Ensure the companion computer is connected to the internet"
msgstr "确保机载计算机已连接互联网"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:35
#: ce7a89e0b56f45fdb238beb8cf13f5a6 e66aa14e04ca4bf8ac600389a6a0c0cc
#: f9f256c712934678b52b819b27277054
msgid "From the left menu, select \"Extensions\""
msgstr "在左侧菜单中选择 \"Extensions\""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:36
#: 822b77451435474caceff073b6b5d869 dc9d26bb7d9e4bdcab3b9634449c3656
#: f7de45ea46684e6f91a31e9c99702fc9
msgid "Search for \"opticalflow\" and push the \"GET\" and \"INSTALL\" buttons"
msgstr "搜索 \"opticalflow\"，然后点击 \"GET\" 和 \"INSTALL\" 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:42
#: 12d63c922c1548d7a0808ea1d6c81439 171e347b7e6149e5852113c7065427b1
#: b741c943d98a46b683f437299a2351b7
msgid "From the left menu, select \"OpticalFlow\""
msgstr "在左侧菜单中选择 \"OpticalFlow\""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:43
#: 08a0173fe051486781e532780fa9de1f f45586163b6a466ca84d58be5a65077e
#: fba21289243047858fdcc30aece7eb1d
msgid "Select the \"Camera Type\" being used"
msgstr "选择所使用的 \"Camera Type\""

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:44
#: 30a62e9181d44963a9ffc6772a9b2a52 48d47ef9ba824643ad63a2b63551c3e4
#: 510e83dec8094a34b7782fddc5e860cd
msgid ""
"Adjust the RTSP URL if not using the camera gimbal's default IP address or "
"RTSP stream"
msgstr "如果没有使用相机云台默认的 IP 地址或 RTSP 流，请调整 RTSP URL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:45
#: 0609561033cd41a28e97f42bba6196ae 8bb6bad6f21d466cbd3b422c67e83fc8
#: af4581ba4ab548bb992be80119aeb8ca
msgid ""
"\"Flight Controller SysID\" should match the vehicle's :ref:`MAV_SYSID "
"<MAV_SYSID>` parameter (normally 1)"
msgstr ""
"\"Flight Controller SysID\" 应与机体的 :ref:`MAV_SYSID <MAV_SYSID>` 参数一致（通常为 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:46
#: 0cdba30114ce42f28210873d2e4042fe 2b28a263dbbc405bba46dc4130b484bf
#: c8806c5f5787401e89bf8a3bf9a6d8b8
msgid "Optionally adjust the Horizontal FOV to match the camera gimbal's lens"
msgstr "可选：调整水平 FOV 以匹配相机云台的镜头"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:53
#: 27364a4e1b6e413a999b54d7d8afb458 892d1e7425b641368df60b4ac7c55537
#: d8b064d1a8aa49228dce6bc3bea7f380
msgid "AutoPilot Configuration and Calibration"
msgstr "飞控配置与校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:55
#: 0e7d718bb2ad46d4bf8aff9570d310fc aedec44168134ea4a53650d21e32f19a
#: c48621918e5845df897aca111ecc1297
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 5（MAVLink），然后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:56
#: 90a492679e6b446f99ee8be9126b19a6 b2cc70799af94b4584ef14b3bf25780e
#: f4f3006e3873429e9ea6645342d59d94
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_OPTIONS <FLOW_OPTIONS>` = 1 (Roll/Pitch stabilised)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_OPTIONS <FLOW_OPTIONS>` = 1（横滚/俯仰已增稳）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:57
#: 9a9a3ba1049c401abd2cbbd5becb47de b69fbde42f234d2482a8b77fe011c53f
#: e2aba0f681bc42dd9fd6af7ad4abc87a
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` = 150 (ms)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` = 150（ms）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:58
#: 31c3fb5f2c8746fa8a644cae24dc512d ae39108d29a246a3bc06d77f25e8114b
#: db3db17ec21e424aafb3196bd3daea87
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`EK3_OPTIONS <EK3_OPTIONS>` = 4 (Optflow may use terrain"
" alt) to allow optical flow to be used beyond the rangefinder's maximum "
"range"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`EK3_OPTIONS <EK3_OPTIONS>` = 4（光流可使用地形高度），以允许在超出测距仪最大量程后继续使用光流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:59
#: 0cf3968cb57d430b923fc4c1dbb57632 16c5a9eb97d34b879672f2ae841ed3a8
#: cfcefdbd35444a89a648675ff55db7c5
msgid ""
"The \"Inflight Calibration\" and \"Log based Calibration\" methods described"
" in the :ref:`Optical Flow Sensor Testing and Setup <common-optical-flow-"
"sensor-setup>` will not work for stabilised camera gimbals.  Instead the "
"Extension's \"Horizontal FOV\" field can be adjusted if the vehicle's "
"estimated position on the map (when using optical flow) significantly "
"overshoots or undershoots the actual distance moved."
msgstr ""
":ref:`光流传感器测试与设置 <common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` 中描述的 \"Inflight "
"Calibration\" 和 \"Log based Calibration\" "
"方法不适用于带增稳的相机云台。替代做法是：如果使用光流时飞行器在地图上的估计位置明显大于或小于实际移动距离，可调整扩展中的 \"Horizontal "
"FOV\" 字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:60
#: b6c38562681b45a3a7b3344c925c31d0 e6d093294a764db6a5acfcf808f83b0f
#: fdaf72a8efac4b028cbfc80a4007ca0d
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the camera gimbal is "
"mounted 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以改善性能。例如，若相机云台安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，则将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为"
" 0.02，:ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:63
#: 2b58c26af9504641b2855e0bb9d650f8 98474b4a8f6c4d39be8e388c12544d89
#: fb3daea047df46ebb5f600dce56b8a41
msgid "Testing and Setup"
msgstr "测试与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-blueos-opticalflow.rst:65
#: 0b542c8d2a1d4b56bf0160a2fc29e654 184f45e38a0f48ca9727db12b3b9c06b
#: dbce6d1038f74c0da4f160c24f71faa4
msgid "See :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup`"
msgstr "参见 :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup`"
